rt.\n\n**Pulmonary**: Spirometry today: FVC 68% predicted (declining), FEV1/FVC ratio normal. Peak cough flow 240 L/min (below threshold of 270). Mild intercostal retractions at rest.\n\n**Functional**: NSAA score 12/34 (significant decline from 22/34 one year ago). Unable to stand from floor without furniture. Unable to climb 4 steps within 12 seconds.',
